Open Food Facts data in testdata/products.tsv

Contains information from Open Food Facts, which is made available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0.

(c) Open Food Facts contributors

Source:    https://static.openfoodfacts.org/data/en.openfoodfacts.org.products.csv.gz
Retrieved: 2026-11-11

testdata/products.tsv is a derived database: a few rows of the export,
trimmed to the columns code, product_name, brands, categories_tags,
countries_tags, nutriscore_grade and quantity, plus a url column rebuilt
from the code. It also holds three synthetic rows (codes 9990000000001,
9990000000002 and an empty one) that are not Open Food Facts data.

